1
00:00:00,120 --> 00:00:01,520
and was slapped with a fine of over 1.5 billion yuan.

2
00:00:04,100 --> 00:00:06,880
Not only was Pinduoduo's fine the largest among all platforms,

3
00:00:06,880 --> 00:00:09,240
It also led to an incident of violent resistance to law enforcement.

4
00:00:12,440 --> 00:00:15,240
The entire incident escalated from playing games and being vague to actual physical violence.

5
00:00:15,240 --> 00:00:17,160
The whole thing was more dramatic than a movie.

6
00:00:17,160 --> 00:00:18,700
According to the details released by the authorities,

7
00:00:18,700 --> 00:00:19,800
So, let's break down what happened.

8
00:00:19,800 --> 00:00:23,250
So, what exactly happened during this three-day, two-night standoff?

9
00:00:23,250 --> 00:00:25,770
Let's turn the clock back to December 3rd, 2025.

10
00:00:25,770 --> 00:00:27,210
The task force moved in on Pinduoduo.

11
00:00:27,210 --> 00:00:30,180
to collect evidence and audit the platform's data related to the 'ghost takeout' businesses.

12
00:00:30,180 --> 00:00:34,020
But from 10 in the morning until 11 at night, for a full thirteen hours,

13
00:00:34,020 --> 00:00:35,380
But the platform repeatedly stalled.

14
00:00:35,380 --> 00:00:36,760
They were just beating around the bush, refusing to hand over the data.

15
00:00:36,760 --> 00:00:39,140
They even concealed their actual office location.

16
00:00:39,140 --> 00:00:40,220
To move the investigation forward,

17
00:00:40,220 --> 00:00:42,019
The task force had to find another way.

18
00:00:42,019 --> 00:00:44,499
By tracking the movement of employees during the evening rush hour,

19
00:00:44,499 --> 00:00:46,459
They managed to track down their actual workplace.

20
00:00:46,459 --> 00:00:48,180
and discovered a suspicious office.

21
00:00:48,180 --> 00:00:50,840
But when the law enforcement officers identified themselves and attempted to enter,

22
00:00:50,840 --> 00:00:52,300
But the Pinduoduo employees slammed the door shut.

23
00:00:52,300 --> 00:00:54,400
During the struggle for control of the door,

24
00:00:54,400 --> 00:00:57,380
One of the officers, Guo Hui, had his hand deliberately caught in the door.

25
00:00:57,380 --> 00:00:58,280
resulting in a fracture.

26
00:00:58,280 --> 00:01:01,420
Only then did the person in charge at Pinduoduo finally relent and agree to provide the data.

27
00:01:01,420 --> 00:01:02,900
But they just kept stalling.

28
00:01:02,900 --> 00:01:04,500
They stalled from 3 a.m. all the way to 5 a.m.

29
00:01:04,500 --> 00:01:06,000
Then, they dragged it out until noon.

30
00:01:06,000 --> 00:01:07,480
by the time it was handed over to the task force,

31
00:01:07,480 --> 00:01:09,250
the data was already severely compromised.

32
00:01:09,250 --> 00:01:10,430
December 4th.

33
00:01:10,430 --> 00:01:12,730
The task force coordinated with the local Public Security Bureau for a joint enforcement operation.

34
00:01:12,730 --> 00:01:15,160
They also demanded that Pinduoduo's Chief Technology Officer perform the operation on the spot.

35
00:01:15,160 --> 00:01:16,420
But by 11 PM that night,

36
00:01:16,420 --> 00:01:19,010
Pinduoduo's head of security suddenly lost control.

37
00:01:19,010 --> 00:01:21,410
He led a group of people and stormed the investigation site.

38
00:01:21,410 --> 00:01:23,500
They were shoving and grappling right in front of the police.

39
00:01:23,500 --> 00:01:25,840
Guo Hui, who had fractured his hand the day before, stepped forward to intervene.

40
00:01:25,840 --> 00:01:26,800
He was shoved to the ground.

41
00:01:26,800 --> 00:01:27,600
He landed on his head.

42
00:01:27,600 --> 00:01:29,430
He was taken to the hospital by an ambulance.

43
00:01:29,430 --> 00:01:30,770
Seeing the situation spiraling out of control,

44
00:01:30,770 --> 00:01:32,190
And then, a truly absurd scene unfolded.

45
00:01:32,190 --> 00:01:33,430
Pinduoduo's Chief Technology Officer

46
00:01:33,430 --> 00:01:34,820
After a private word with his colleague,

47
00:01:34,820 --> 00:01:36,040
suddenly collapsed to the ground.

48
00:01:36,040 --> 00:01:38,200
The ambulance took away the law enforcement officer who had a real fracture,

49
00:01:38,200 --> 00:01:39,860
and took away the Oscar-worthy actor who was faking his illness.

50
00:01:39,860 --> 00:01:40,660
Once at the hospital,

51
00:01:40,660 --> 00:01:43,760
The doctor confirmed that the director's heart and body were both fine.

52
00:01:43,760 --> 00:01:44,620
But what no one saw coming...

53
00:01:44,620 --> 00:01:47,700
What was supposed to be a routine on-site evidence collection escalated into a violent conflict.

54
00:01:47,700 --> 00:01:48,720
On December 5th,

55
00:01:50,720 --> 00:01:53,020
It was only the second time that Pinduoduo had provided the relevant data.

56
00:01:53,020 --> 00:01:54,700
But the confrontation was far from over.

57
00:01:54,700 --> 00:01:56,460
That day, at the task force's headquarters,

58
00:01:59,220 --> 00:02:02,540
An employee wrote down the words "remain silent" and "do not speak" on a piece of A4 paper.

59
00:02:02,540 --> 00:02:05,400
to warn a colleague being questioned not to reveal any information.

60
00:02:05,400 --> 00:02:06,520
After being caught red-handed,

61
00:02:06,520 --> 00:02:08,039
Then, something even more absurd happened.

62
00:02:08,039 --> 00:02:09,860
This employee, right in front of everyone,

63
00:02:09,860 --> 00:02:11,560
He quickly crumpled the A4 paper into a ball,

64
00:02:11,560 --> 00:02:12,860
and forced it down his throat.

65
00:02:12,860 --> 00:02:13,680
When facing regulation,

66
00:02:13,680 --> 00:02:16,100
Every platform has its own playbook for dealing with regulators.

67
00:02:16,100 --> 00:02:18,250
But this time, with Pinduoduo's defiance of the law,

68
00:02:18,250 --> 00:02:19,590
From a fake fall to swallowing a note,

69
00:02:19,590 --> 00:02:20,890
From acting to violence.

70
00:02:24,150 --> 00:02:25,260
How arrogant can they be?

71
00:02:25,260 --> 00:02:27,660
On that A4 paper, the one a Pinduoduo employee swallowed whole...

72
00:02:27,660 --> 00:02:29,040
was written with the words 'silence' and 'say nothing'.

73
00:02:29,040 --> 00:02:32,360
But the facts and the truth can never be swallowed or silenced.

